<title>UK: IRAQ'S AUGUST CEYHAN OIL EXPORT SCHEDULE DETAILED.</title>
<headline>IRAQ'S AUGUST CEYHAN OIL EXPORT SCHEDULE DETAILED.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of the preliminary loading schedule for Iraqi Kirkuk crude loadings for the period August 12-31:</p>
<p>Tanker		     Date   Volume     Buyer</p>
<p>					(million bbls)</p>
<p>Arcadia		    12/8    2.10	Bayoil/US</p>
<p>New Horizon		15/8    1.00	Coastal/US</p>
<p>Landsort		   16/8    1.00	Total/France</p>
<p>Tromso Fidelity	  17/8    1.00	Coastal/US</p>
<p>Chickasaw		  18/8    1.00	Repsol/Spain</p>
<p>Mega Point		 20/8    0.90	Chevron/US</p>
<p>by pipeline		20/8    0.65	Tupras/Turkey</p>
<p>to be nominated (TBN)  22/8    0.45	Rosneft/Russia</p>
<p>TBN			  23/8    0.97	Nafta/Russia</p>
<p>Norde J Transporter    24/8    1.00	Total/France</p>
<p>TBN			  25/8    1.00	Agip/Italy</p>
<p>by pipeline		25/8    0.65	Tupras/Turkey</p>
<p>TBN			  27/8    0.97	to be announced</p>
<p>Birch/Marble	     28/8    1.00	Total/France</p>
<p>Kuzbass		    29/8    1.00	Repsol/Spain</p>
<p>TBN			  30/8    0.90	to be announced</p>
<p>Kalkavan		   30/8    1.025     to be announced</p>
<p>Queen			31/8    0.90	Repsol/Spain</p>
<p>Total				 17.515 (875,000 barrels a day)</p>
<p>--Richard Mably, London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
